      "description": "Working with the Enterprise 360 One Voice team within CSEO to help Customer Advocates within Microsoft get the information they need to serve our customers.\n\nSpecifically:\nI built a system to return the warranty repair status of a customer's Surface device and integrated that system with Microsoft's phone system and chat bots so customers could learn of their device's status before having to talk to a Customer Advocate.\nI troubleshooted, performed maintenance, and added features to a core set of micro-services supporting Microsoft's phone system and handling millions of API calls a day.\nI built, tested, and integrated services to support a natural voice chat bot handling support requests for MS Store.\nI created an internal short URL service for temporary self-expiring links designed to handle large call volumes.\nI built a web portal for sending text notifications to customers, including tracking sent messages, getting delivery notifications, and scoping access to campaigns to the correct call center and team responsible for them.\nI regularly mentor my teammates, perform code reviews, set up opportunities for training, and advise on projects outside my direct team.",
