      "description": "Responsible for designing and building internal applications along with the web infrastructure to support them.\nServed as a mentor for a development team of over 10.\nResearched new technologies and techniques for the development team to utilize, including introducing agile methodologies to the company for the first time.\nPerformed interviews of candidates and helped to develop the interview process.\nBuilt an in-house SDK for iOS apps containing libraries for data transfer, updates, authentication, and other application services.\nSetup TeamCity to automate deployments of internal software which introduced the concepts of Continuous Integration and Continuous Deployment to the company.\nWrote several REST services using ASP.NET Web API to support our iOS applications.",
